  _senarioDescription: You run over to the landline and begin to dial 9 - 1 - 1 as
    you put the phone up to your ear, but nothing, not a sound comes from the phone.
    You look down following the cord only to realize that it has been cut. An immediate
    panic sets in knowing that something has deliberately done this. Knowing no one
    will be coming to help you, you must take matters into your own hands. Should
    you check this floor, upstairs, or the basement first?
